# Backend & REST API Configuration
# • Database: Cloud Firebase (Firestore & Realtime DB — see Firebase section below)
# • This application runs in "Direct Firebase Mode" — no separate Express/Node
#   backend server is needed. All data persistence goes directly to Firebase Cloud.
# • Set these to empty ("") for Direct Firebase Mode (RECOMMENDED for production).
# • ONLY set a URL if you deploy your own Express REST API server.
# Node.js Express Backend & Database Server Configuration
